{title: Aigiri Nandini}
{artist: Mahishasura Mardini Stotra}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Ayi giri nandini, nandhitha medhini,        [C] Viswa vinodhini nanda [A#m] nuthe,
[A#] Girivara vindhya [C#] sirodhi nivasini,        [A#m] Vishnu Vilasini [C] Jishnu nuthe,
[C] Bhagawathi hey sithi kanda kudumbini,        [C] Bhoori kudumbini bhoori [A#m] kruthe,
[A#] Jaya Jaya He Mahi [C#] shasura Mardini,        [A#m] Ramya Kapardini [C] Shaila Suthe
[C] Suravara varshini, durdara darshini,        [C] Durmukhamarshani, harsha [A#m] rathe,
[A#] Tribhuvana poshini, [C#] Sankara thoshini,        [A#m] Kilbisisha moshini, [C] ghosha rathe,
[C] Danuja niroshini, Dithisutha roshini,        [C] Durmatha soshini, Sindhu [A#m] suthe,
[A#] Jaya Jaya Hey Mahi [C#] shasura Mardini,        [A#m] Ramya Kapardini [A#] Shaila Suthe
[C] Ayi Jagadambha Madambha, Kadambha,        [C] Vana priya vasini, Hasa [A#m] rathe,
[A#] Shikhari siromani, [C#] thunga Himalaya,        [A#m] Srunga nijalaya, [C] madhyagathe,
[C] Madhu Madure, Mdhukaitabha banjini,        [C] Kaitabha banjini, rasa [A#m] rathe,
[A#] Jaya Jaya He Mahi [C#] shasura Mardini,        [A#m] Ramya Kapardini [C] Shaila Suthe
